@gateway = http://127.0.0.1:8081
@admin = http://127.0.0.1:9191
@adminToken = dev-security-token

### 1. Clean request - expected 200 and X-Security-Action: ALLOW
GET {{gateway}}/api/products

### 2. SQL injection in JSON - expected 403 and X-Security-Action: BLOCK
POST {{gateway}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin' OR 1=1 --"
}

### 3. Encoded XSS query - expected 403 and X-Security-Action: BLOCK
GET {{gateway}}/search?q=%3Cscript%3Ejavascript%3Aalert%281%29%3C%2Fscript%3E

### 4. Inspect recent security events; look for event="waf_blocked"
GET {{admin}}/api/v1/logs?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
